description: Process entry: run.py calls startup, which loads core clients
globs: "**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow [startup](../recommendations/backend/startup.md).

## run.py

```python
from app.startup import startup

if __name__ == "__main__":
    try:
        startup()
    except KeyboardInterrupt:
        print("Forced exit...")
    except Exception as err:
        print(err)
```

## app/startup.py

```python
from logging import getLogger

from dotenv import load_dotenv

logger = getLogger(__name__)


def startup():
    load_dotenv()
    from app import core

    logger.info("Startup application")
    core.redis.ping()
```

## app/core/media_client.py

```python
from app.media_client import MediaClient
from .settings import settings

media_client = MediaClient(settings.minio.minio_uri)
```

## app/core/logging.py import side

```python
import logging
import logging.config

from app.core import settings
from app.utils.files import read_yaml

LOGGING_CONFIG = read_yaml(settings.logging.config_path)
logging.config.dictConfig(LOGGING_CONFIG)
```

